## BATCH MODE: Process multiple accounts from file
## ============================================

## Uncomment and modify to process accounts from log.txt format

## NOTES:
## 1. This SVB script handles single account extraction
## 2. For batch processing of 200+ accounts, use the Python version: plan_extractor.py
## 3. The Python version includes:
##    - Automatic account iteration
##    - Rate limiting (ROE compliant: 5 req/sec)
##    - Multiple endpoint attempts
##    - HTML fallback parsing
##    - CSV/JSON export
## 4. Plan endpoint configuration needed - currently using placeholder
##    - Verify correct endpoint with PortSwigger API documentation
##    - Test endpoint manually before running batch

## Usage:
## 1. For single account: Run this SVB script directly
## 2. For batch (200+ accounts): Use Python script:
##    python3 plan_extractor.py

## Error Handling Notes:
## - HTTP 401: Account credentials may be invalid or session expired
## - HTTP 403: Account may not have permission to access plans
## - HTTP 404: Plan endpoint may be incorrect
## - HTTP 429: Rate limited - increase delay between requests
